    <item>
        <location>/app/code/amaranth/hdl/_ir.py</location>
        <description>IO port transformation errors in netlist building</description>
        <contract>
            The build_netlist function must properly handle IOPort objects when converting them to netlist representations. Specifically, it should correctly process IOBufferInstance and other IO-related constructs without raising "Cannot transform value" errors.
